###############################################
# 10. Achievement Milestones Test
###############################################

### Check Achievement Progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Achievements you should see based on progress:
# 🎯 First Steps        - After 1 lesson
# 📚 Dedicated Learner  - After 10 lessons
# ⭐ Halfway Hero       - After 30 lessons
# 🏆 Course Champion    - After 60 lessons
# 🔥 On Fire           - 3-day streak
# 💪 Week Warrior      - 7-day streak
# 🌟 Month Master      - 30-day streak
# 🎓 High Achiever     - 70+ average
# 💯 Perfect Student   - 90+ average
# 📖 Word Collector    - 50 words
# 🧠 Vocabulary Master - 200 words

###

